{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7d31bb9e76fd7330","name":"Shadow Academy Senior Student","source":{"id":"source:reference-7d31bb9e76fd7330","title":"Shadow Academy Senior Student","revision":20517,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:00:30Z","sha256":"2204892237c6aebc71debdfd31af125e73fdbc4c36ebfe2d3e656b737509a53f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20517","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shadow%20Academy%20Senior%20Student&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7d31bb9e76fd7330","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of Luke Skywalker's early failures as leader of the New Jedi Order is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"},". The young student's fall to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," forces him to leave the academy and pursue training elsewhere. With the assistance of a group of witches from the Nightsister clan of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dathomir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dathomir?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," establishes ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," for the Second Imperium of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," equivalent of Skywalker's Jedi Praxeum on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin 4"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin_4","referenceId":"reference:5f008a1b1f754b64"},". Unlike the doctrines of the Nightsisters, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," allows both male and female members. The students undergo a rigorous training regime to push them toward graduating as full-fledged Dark Jedi, ready to fight and eliminate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," under Skywalker's tutelage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The students of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," serve to defend their school, much like ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," students on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin 4"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin_4","referenceId":"reference:5f008a1b1f754b64"},", as well as help achieve the goals of their masters, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tamith Kai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tamith_Kai","referenceId":"reference:0d3551b5c498a7cc"},". Time and again, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," uses his students as pawns in his plans to eliminate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The students of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," harass ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"}," and his students for several years through one plan or another. However, much of the influence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," comes to a close after the destruction of the space station where it is housed, and Brakiss's subsequent death aboard it. Many students survive the station's destruction by being elsewhere at the time and pursue the secrets of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," on their own.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shadow Academy Student Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The students of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Shadow Academy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Shadow_Academy","referenceId":"reference:91a663a42595a40f"}," provide a good supply of low-level Dark Jedi at throw at the heroes during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Jedi Order Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Jedi_Order_Era"}," and can provide a legitimate source of future villains in campaigns set during the Yuuzhan Vong Invasion and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"}," (the period before, during, and after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith-Imperial War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith-Imperial_War"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Shadow Academy Senior Student Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 4; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"):"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 17), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 18, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 17; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"